2026-07-27T09:50:41.5711679Z i /tmp/RtmpliynmB/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:50:41.5712067Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:50:41.5712760Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:50:41.5713163Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:50:41.5713780Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:50:41.5714708Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:50:41.5715765Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
